## Original Content
À l’exception de l’extrême gauche mélenchoniste, tous les candidats à l’élection présidentielle leur promettront sans doute un soutien sans faille jeudi devant les patrons.

## Summary
This editorial discusses how all French presidential candidates, except those from the far-left, are expected to promise unwavering support to businesses during an event with business leaders. The title suggests that businesses desire more than just slogans, implying a need for substantive actions.

## Key Points
- All presidential candidates except the far-left will likely promise support to businesses.
- The promises will be made in front of business leaders on Thursday.
- Businesses want more than just empty slogans, as indicated by the editorial title.


